{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A car travels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> miles from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour but returns the same distance at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour. The average speed for the round trip is closest to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/d/59d88840b68cb72fc79e400a800bd8af98fce6d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 33\\text{ mph}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 34\\text{ mph}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 35\\text{ mph}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 36\\text{ mph}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 37\\text{ mph}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"583\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The car takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/c/c4c5ebfd7afbe25ac3150d1625af21ee456e0d1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120 \\text{ miles }\\cdot\\dfrac{1 \\text{ hr }}{30 \\text{ miles }}=4 \\text{ hr}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"213\" height=\"37\" /> to get from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. Also, it takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/8/388f6bff34ea3cfce169f2d70b54b65db177f87a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120 \\text{ miles }\\cdot\\dfrac{1 \\text{ hr }}{40 \\text{ miles }}=3 \\text{ hr}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"213\" height=\"37\" /> to get from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, the average speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33eb321bfc37e67a0310a057007cf1183f2cc431.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{240\\text{ miles }}{7 \\text{ hr}}=34\\dfrac{2}{7}\\text{ mph}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"172\" height=\"38\" />, which is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/7170eb34e0bdca42b34724a39ec3fcf3dde11586.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 34\\text{ mph}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"101\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_